[Desktop Entry]
# Wallet launcher for "Postern for postmarketOS -- community edition".
# HONESTY: the wallet is a CLI (`postern-wallet`, bloch-crypto's wallet::cli).
# It opens in a terminal -- this is not a graphical wallet, and the keys are in
# a SOFTWARE keystore (no TEE/StrongBox on this platform; ../../HONESTY.md).
# UNBOOTED: never launched under phosh on a device.
Type=Application
Name=Postern Wallet
Comment=Offline post-quantum wallet CLI (software keystore) -- opens in a terminal
Exec=postern-wallet
Terminal=true
Categories=Network;Utility;Finance;
Keywords=postern;wallet;crypto;
X-Postern-Edition=postmarketOS-community
